  Trial 2: 1.1180 seconds | Sorted: YES
  Trial 3: 1.1250 seconds | Sorted: YES
  Trial 4: 1.1200 seconds | Sorted: YES
  Trial 5: 1.1190 seconds | Sorted: YES

--- Naive Custom QuickSort ---
  Trial 1: 1.9540 seconds | Sorted: YES
  Trial 2: 1.9710 seconds | Sorted: YES
  Trial 3: 1.9620 seconds | Sorted: YES
  Trial 4: 1.9580 seconds | Sorted: YES
  Trial 5: 1.9650 seconds | Sorted: YES

--- Improved Custom QuickSort ---
  Trial 1: 1.2840 seconds | Sorted: YES
  Trial 2: 1.2910 seconds | Sorted: YES
  Trial 3: 1.2780 seconds | Sorted: YES
  Trial 4: 1.2860 seconds | Sorted: YES
  Trial 5: 1.2820 seconds | Sorted: YES

